  "scope": "Add explicit, asynchronous history cleanup and validated conflict inspection/resolution controls in the native egui UI.",
  "behavior": [
    "History cleanup requires a review step followed by an explicit confirmation that displays the eligible count and size; unresolved conflicts remain protected.",
    "Conflict inspection reads current and incoming versions asynchronously and displays text previews capped at 16 KiB; binary content is omitted and SHA-256 revisions are shown.",
    "Keep Current and Keep Incoming require their own confirmation. Keep Incoming retains the stored current-revision precondition.",
    "Failed cleanup invalidates its preview. Failed conflict resolution closes the stale inspection so the user must refresh and inspect again.",
    "History work remains on a Rayon worker and returns to the UI through a channel."
  ],
